Yaesu FT-710.</p><p><strong>FreeRig710:</strong> ESP32-P4 radio control, live video, browser audio and integrated FT8.</p><p><strong>Unified audio/PTT:</strong> the production GUI uses <code>/api/v1/audio/ws</code> for RX PCM, browser microphone PCM and latching PTT with a 1.5 s safety watchdog.</p><p><img class="video" src="/video.mjpeg" alt="Live HDMI video"></p><ul><li><a href="/video.mjpeg">/video.mjpeg</a> (live MJPEG)</li><li><a href="/api/v1/hardware/audio">/api/v1/hardware/audio</a> (RX + TX UAC1 status)</li><li><a href="/api/v1/hardware/cat">/api/v1/hardware/cat</a></li><li><a href="/api/v1/radio/state">/api/v1/radio/state</a></li><li><a href="/api/v1/hardware/usb">/api/v1/hardware/usb</a></li><li><a href="/api/v1/health">/api/v1/health</a></li></ul></body></html>␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀p@1␀␀␀␀␀␀␀p@2␀␀␀␀␀␀␀(p@3␀␀␀␀␀␀␀рѓ@4␀␀␀␀␀␀Р@5␀␀␀␀␀␀Hp@6␀␀␀␀␀␀␀0p@7␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Фї@8␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Pp@9␀␀␀␀␀␀␀ђq@A␀␀␀␀␀␀@p@B␀␀␀␀␀␀¤p@C␀␀␀␀␀␀␀8p@D␀␀␀␀␀␀ґ¬@E␀␀␀␀␀␀␀„q@F␀␀␀␀␀␀АЃ@Ьї@дї@мї@фї@ьї@8z@А@А@А@¤Ѓ@А@$А@0z@,А@4А@$z@0␀␀␀<А@1␀␀␀HА@2␀␀␀TА@3␀␀␀lА@4␀␀␀„А@6␀␀␀њА@7␀␀␀ґА@9␀␀␀МА@A␀␀␀␀H␀дА@А3␀O␀мА@@w␀Ђ„␀фА@аg5␀␀	=␀ьА@ 5M␀)S␀␀Б@АПj␀ co␀Б@ љ␀pаљ␀Б@ЂџХ␀°цЪ␀Б@ ІА8Б@@o@MGБ@ђК{0Q}Б@␀?« /ЕБ@ЂръЂщ7 Б@Ђ,А_;$Б@0123456789ABCDEF␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀p—@␀␀␀␀␀␀@␀␀␀␀␀pЗ@␀␀␀␀␀␀™@␀␀␀␀␀␀T@␀␀␀␀␀ќМ@␀␀␀␀␀И™@␀␀␀␀␀␀рї␀␀␀␀␀␀р?␀␀␀␀␀:ў@␀␀␀␀␀␀@␀␀␀␀␀␀@333333у?љ™™™™™Щ?␀␀␀␀␀pз@␀␀␀␀␀LН@␀␀␀␀␀␀4@љ™™™™™й?␀␀␀␀␀@Џ@␀␀␀␀␀␀°<␀␀АяяяЯA␀␀␀␀␀␀аБяяяяяяп␀␀␀␀␀␀ш␀␀␀␀␀␀рНМММММММ␀␀␀␀␀аБб=UUUUХ?ЏВu=␀␀ В␀␀ЂїЧЈp?␀@F␀␀ AНМL>␀␀␀В␀␀ A␀юяF␀␀zD␀␀Ђ␀␀Ђ?␀Єё?pҐм6␀␀Ђ>␀␀␀?;Єё?␀␀ЂKBсS>U2l>Ј‹>«ЄЄ>·mЫ>љ™?␀␀@@␀@v?O8v?Ж#цё<Є83␀r1?r1?Њѕї5L»13кЭ5UіЉ8a6;«Є*>␀␀␀@␀␀␀L␀␀␀3␀␀ЂЂ␀␀Ђ␀яяяяяjpeg_del_encoder_engine␀s_cfg_desc␀␀s_jpeg_set_header_info␀␀jpeg_ll_sample_mode_select␀␀s_jpeg_enc_transaction_on_job_picked␀␀␀␀jpeg_encoder_process␀␀␀␀jpeg_encoder_process␀␀␀␀jpeg_new_encoder_engine␀jpeg_new_encoder_engine␀jpeg_check_intr_priority␀␀␀␀jpeg_acquire_code